{"title":"Python爬虫实战：模拟登录古诗文网","slug":"2024-07-26-requests_古诗文网","date":"2024-07-26T04:49:51.000Z","updated":"2024-07-26T04:49:51.000Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2024-07-26-requests_古诗文网.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<span id=\"more\"></span>\n<h2 id=\"一、-需求分析\"><a href=\"#一、-需求分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"一、 需求分析\"></a>一、 需求分析</h2><p>本次实战的目标是使用 Python 的 <code>requests</code> 库模拟登录<strong>古诗文网</strong>。</p>\n<p>在开始编写代码之前，我们需要通过浏览器的开发者工具（F12）分析登录接口的请求参数。经过分析，我们发现登录接口 (<code>/user/login.aspx</code>) 包含以下关键参数：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><p><strong>常规参数</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>email</code>: 用户账号</li>\n<li><code>pwd</code>: 用户密码</li>\n<li><code>code</code>: 验证码</li>\n<li><code>denglu</code>: 登录按钮（值为 “登录”）</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>动态隐藏参数</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>__VIEWSTATE</code></li>\n<li><code>__VIEWSTATEGENERATOR</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这两个参数是 ASP.NET 框架特有的状态管理参数，每次请求页面时都会动态生成。如果我们直接发送固定的参数值，服务器将无法验证通过，导致登录失败。</p>\n<h2 id=\"二、-难点解析与应对策略\"><a href=\"#二、-难点解析与应对策略\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"二、 难点解析与应对策略\"></a>二、 难点解析与应对策略</h2><h3 id=\"1-动态参数获取\"><a href=\"#1-动态参数获取\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 动态参数获取\"></a>1. 动态参数获取</h3><p><strong>难点</strong>：<code>__VIEWSTATE</code> 和 <code>__VIEWSTATEGENERATOR</code> 的值是动态变化的，无法硬编码。</p>\n<p><strong>解决方案</strong>：<br>这两个参数通常隐藏在登录页面的 HTML 源码中，以 <code>&lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot;&gt;</code> 标签形式存在。</p>\n<p>查看网页源码，我们可以定位到如下标签：<br><figure class=\"highlight html\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br><span class=\"line\">70</span><br><span class=\"line\">71</span><br><span class=\"line\">72</span><br><span class=\"line\">73</span><br><span class=\"line\">74</span><br><span class=\"line\">75</span><br><span class=\"line\">76</span><br><span class=\"line\">77</span><br><span class=\"line\">78</span><br><span class=\"line\">79</span><br><span class=\"line\">80</span><br><span class=\"line\">81</span><br><span class=\"line\">82</span><br><span class=\"line\">83</span><br><span class=\"line\">84</span><br><span class=\"line\">85</span><br><span class=\"line\">86</span><br><span class=\"line\">87</span><br><span class=\"line\">88</span><br><span class=\"line\">89</span><br><span class=\"line\">90</span><br><span class=\"line\">91</span><br><span class=\"line\">92</span><br><span class=\"line\">93</span><br><span class=\"line\">94</span><br><span class=\"line\">95</span><br><span class=\"line\">96</span><br><span class=\"line\">97</span><br><span class=\"line\">98</span><br><span class=\"line\">99</span><br><span class=\"line\">100</span><br><span class=\"line\">101</span><br><span class=\"line\">102</span><br><span class=\"line\">103</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">input</span> <span class=\"attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;hidden&quot;</span> <span class=\"attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;__VIEWSTATE&quot;</span> <span class=\"attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;__VIEWSTATE&quot;</span> <span class=\"attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;ezxzwyAx+ftix1tysT...&quot;</span> /&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">input</span> <span class=\"attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;hidden&quot;</span> <span class=\"attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;__VIEWSTATEGENERATOR&quot;</span> <span class=\"attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;__VIEWSTATEGENERATOR&quot;</span> <span class=\"attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;C93BE1AE&quot;</span> /&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">**实现步骤**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">1.  使用 `requests.get()` 请求登录页面。</span><br><span class=\"line\">2.  利用 `BeautifulSoup` 解析 HTML。</span><br><span class=\"line\">3.  通过 ID 选择器提取这两个隐藏域的 `value` 值。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">### 2. 验证码处理</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">**难点**：登录需要输入验证码，机器难以自动识别。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">**解决方案**（本文采用人工辅助方式）：</span><br><span class=\"line\">1.  获取验证码图片的 URL。</span><br><span class=\"line\">2.  下载验证码图片到本地。</span><br><span class=\"line\">3.  手动打开图片识别并输入。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">&gt; 提示：在生产环境中，通常可以对接 OCR 识别接口（如 Tesseract、百度 OCR 等）来实现全自动识别。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">## 三、 代码实现</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">以下是完整的模拟登录代码实现。为了保证请求的持续性（即登录成功后能访问个人中心），我们需要使用 `requests.Session()` 来自动管理 Cookie。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\">import requests</span><br><span class=\"line\">from bs4 import BeautifulSoup</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 1. 定义基础 URL 和请求头</span><br><span class=\"line\">url_login = &#x27;https://so.gushiwen.cn/user/login.aspx?from=http://so.gushiwen.cn/user/collect.aspx&#x27;</span><br><span class=\"line\">headers = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#x27;User-Agent&#x27;: &#x27;Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/70.0.3538.110 Safari/537.36&#x27;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 2. 创建 Session 会话对象</span><br><span class=\"line\"># Session 可以自动保存服务器返回的 Cookie，后续请求会自动携带</span><br><span class=\"line\">session = requests.Session()</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 3. 发送 GET 请求获取登录页面源码</span><br><span class=\"line\">response = session.get(url=url_login, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\">content = response.text</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 4. 解析页面源码，提取动态参数</span><br><span class=\"line\">soup = BeautifulSoup(content, &#x27;lxml&#x27;)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 提取 __VIEWSTATE</span><br><span class=\"line\">viewstate_tag = soup.select(&#x27;#__VIEWSTATE&#x27;)[0]</span><br><span class=\"line\">__VIEWSTATE = viewstate_tag.attrs.get(&#x27;value&#x27;)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 提取 __VIEWSTATEGENERATOR</span><br><span class=\"line\">viewstate_gen_tag = soup.select(&#x27;#__VIEWSTATEGENERATOR&#x27;)[0]</span><br><span class=\"line\">__VIEWSTATEGENERATOR = viewstate_gen_tag.attrs.get(&#x27;value&#x27;)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">print(f&quot;获取到 __VIEWSTATE: &#123;__VIEWSTATE&#125;&quot;)</span><br><span class=\"line\">print(f&quot;获取到 __VIEWSTATEGENERATOR: &#123;__VIEWSTATEGENERATOR&#125;&quot;)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 5. 处理验证码</span><br><span class=\"line\"># 找到验证码图片的 URL</span><br><span class=\"line\">code_img_url = &#x27;https://so.gushiwen.cn/RandCode.ashx&#x27;</span><br><span class=\"line\">response_code = session.get(url=code_img_url, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 将验证码图片保存到本地</span><br><span class=\"line\">with open(&#x27;code.jpg&#x27;, &#x27;wb&#x27;) as f:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    f.write(response_code.content)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 手动输入验证码</span><br><span class=\"line\">code_text = input(&quot;请查看本地 code.jpg 图片并输入验证码：&quot;)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 6. 封装 POST 请求参数</span><br><span class=\"line\">data = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#x27;__VIEWSTATE&#x27;: __VIEWSTATE,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#x27;__VIEWSTATEGENERATOR&#x27;: __VIEWSTATEGENERATOR,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#x27;from&#x27;: &#x27;http://so.gushiwen.cn/user/collect.aspx&#x27;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#x27;email&#x27;: &#x27;your_email@example.com&#x27;,  # 替换为你的账号</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#x27;pwd&#x27;: &#x27;your_password&#x27;,             # 替换为你的密码</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#x27;code&#x27;: code_text,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#x27;denglu&#x27;: &#x27;登录&#x27;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">print(&quot;正在发送登录请求...&quot;)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 7. 发送 POST 请求进行登录</span><br><span class=\"line\">response_post = session.post(url=url_login, data=data, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 8. 验证登录结果</span><br><span class=\"line\"># 登录成功后，通常会跳转到个人页面，我们可以判断响应内容</span><br><span class=\"line\">if response_post.status_code == 200:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    # 简单判断：如果页面包含特定关键词，则认为登录成功</span><br><span class=\"line\">    if &#x27;您的收藏&#x27; in response_post.text:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        print(&quot;登录成功！已跳转至个人收藏页面。&quot;)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    else:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        print(&quot;登录失败，请检查账号密码或验证码。&quot;)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        # 可以将响应当作文件打开查看具体原因</span><br><span class=\"line\">        with open(&#x27;login_result.html&#x27;, &#x27;w&#x27;, encoding=&#x27;utf-8&#x27;) as f:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            f.write(response_post.text)</span><br><span class=\"line\">else:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    print(&quot;网络请求异常&quot;)</span><br><span class=\"line\">## 四、 总结</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">本文通过模拟登录古诗文网，重点演示了如何处理 ASP.NET 网站特有的隐藏参数以及验证码的应对流程。核心技巧在于：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">1.  **Session 维持**：使用 `requests.Session()` 确保在获取参数、下载验证码、提交表单这一系列过程中 Cookie 的一致性。</span><br><span class=\"line\">2.  **动态参数解析**：利用 `BeautifulSoup` 在发起请求前动态抓取服务器生成的状态码。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">希望本文对你的爬虫学习有所帮助！</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>\n","more":"<h2 id=\"一、-需求分析\"><a href=\"#一、-需求分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"一、 需求分析\"></a>一、 需求分析</h2><p>本次实战的目标是使用 Python 的 <code>requests</code> 库模拟登录<strong>古诗文网</strong>。</p>\n<p>在开始编写代码之前，我们需要通过浏览器的开发者工具（F12）分析登录接口的请求参数。经过分析，我们发现登录接口 (<code>/user/login.aspx</code>) 包含以下关键参数：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><p><strong>常规参数</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>email</code>: 用户账号</li>\n<li><code>pwd</code>: 用户密码</li>\n<li><code>code</code>: 验证码</li>\n<li><code>denglu</code>: 登录按钮（值为 “登录”）</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>动态隐藏参数</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>__VIEWSTATE</code></li>\n<li><code>__VIEWSTATEGENERATOR</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这两个参数是 ASP.NET 框架特有的状态管理参数，每次请求页面时都会动态生成。如果我们直接发送固定的参数值，服务器将无法验证通过，导致登录失败。</p>\n<h2 id=\"二、-难点解析与应对策略\"><a href=\"#二、-难点解析与应对策略\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"二、 难点解析与应对策略\"></a>二、 难点解析与应对策略</h2><h3 id=\"1-动态参数获取\"><a href=\"#1-动态参数获取\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 动态参数获取\"></a>1. 动态参数获取</h3><p><strong>难点</strong>：<code>__VIEWSTATE</code> 和 <code>__VIEWSTATEGENERATOR</code> 的值是动态变化的，无法硬编码。</p>\n<p><strong>解决方案</strong>：<br>这两个参数通常隐藏在登录页面的 HTML 源码中，以 <code>&lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot;&gt;</code> 标签形式存在。</p>\n<p>查看网页源码，我们可以定位到如下标签：<br><figure class=\"highlight html\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br><span class=\"line\">70</span><br><span class=\"line\">71</span><br><span class=\"line\">72</span><br><span class=\"line\">73</span><br><span class=\"line\">74</span><br><span class=\"line\">75</span><br><span class=\"line\">76</span><br><span class=\"line\">77</span><br><span class=\"line\">78</span><br><span class=\"line\">79</span><br><span class=\"line\">80</span><br><span class=\"line\">81</span><br><span class=\"line\">82</span><br><span class=\"line\">83</span><br><span class=\"line\">84</span><br><span class=\"line\">85</span><br><span class=\"line\">86</span><br><span class=\"line\">87</span><br><span class=\"line\">88</span><br><span class=\"line\">89</span><br><span class=\"line\">90</span><br><span class=\"line\">91</span><br><span class=\"line\">92</span><br><span class=\"line\">93</span><br><span class=\"line\">94</span><br><span class=\"line\">95</span><br><span class=\"line\">96</span><br><span class=\"line\">97</span><br><span class=\"line\">98</span><br><span class=\"line\">99</span><br><span class=\"line\">100</span><br><span class=\"line\">101</span><br><span class=\"line\">102</span><br><span class=\"line\">103</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">input</span> <span class=\"attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;hidden&quot;</span> <span class=\"attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;__VIEWSTATE&quot;</span> <span class=\"attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;__VIEWSTATE&quot;</span> <span class=\"attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;ezxzwyAx+ftix1tysT...&quot;</span> /&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">input</span> <span class=\"attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;hidden&quot;</span> <span class=\"attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;__VIEWSTATEGENERATOR&quot;</span> <span class=\"attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;__VIEWSTATEGENERATOR&quot;</span> <span class=\"attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;C93BE1AE&quot;</span> /&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">**实现步骤**：</span><br><span class=\"line\">1.  使用 `requests.get()` 请求登录页面。</span><br><span class=\"line\">2.  利用 `BeautifulSoup` 解析 HTML。</span><br><span class=\"line\">3.  通过 ID 选择器提取这两个隐藏域的 `value` 值。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">### 2. 验证码处理</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">**难点**：登录需要输入验证码，机器难以自动识别。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">**解决方案**（本文采用人工辅助方式）：</span><br><span class=\"line\">1.  获取验证码图片的 URL。</span><br><span class=\"line\">2.  下载验证码图片到本地。</span><br><span class=\"line\">3.  手动打开图片识别并输入。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">&gt; 提示：在生产环境中，通常可以对接 OCR 识别接口（如 Tesseract、百度 OCR 等）来实现全自动识别。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">## 三、 代码实现</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">以下是完整的模拟登录代码实现。为了保证请求的持续性（即登录成功后能访问个人中心），我们需要使用 `requests.Session()` 来自动管理 Cookie。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\">import requests</span><br><span class=\"line\">from bs4 import BeautifulSoup</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 1. 定义基础 URL 和请求头</span><br><span class=\"line\">url_login = &#x27;https://so.gushiwen.cn/user/login.aspx?from=http://so.gushiwen.cn/user/collect.aspx&#x27;</span><br><span class=\"line\">headers = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#x27;User-Agent&#x27;: &#x27;Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/70.0.3538.110 Safari/537.36&#x27;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 2. 创建 Session 会话对象</span><br><span class=\"line\"># Session 可以自动保存服务器返回的 Cookie，后续请求会自动携带</span><br><span class=\"line\">session = requests.Session()</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 3. 发送 GET 请求获取登录页面源码</span><br><span class=\"line\">response = session.get(url=url_login, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\">content = response.text</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 4. 解析页面源码，提取动态参数</span><br><span class=\"line\">soup = BeautifulSoup(content, &#x27;lxml&#x27;)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 提取 __VIEWSTATE</span><br><span class=\"line\">viewstate_tag = soup.select(&#x27;#__VIEWSTATE&#x27;)[0]</span><br><span class=\"line\">__VIEWSTATE = viewstate_tag.attrs.get(&#x27;value&#x27;)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 提取 __VIEWSTATEGENERATOR</span><br><span class=\"line\">viewstate_gen_tag = soup.select(&#x27;#__VIEWSTATEGENERATOR&#x27;)[0]</span><br><span class=\"line\">__VIEWSTATEGENERATOR = viewstate_gen_tag.attrs.get(&#x27;value&#x27;)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">print(f&quot;获取到 __VIEWSTATE: &#123;__VIEWSTATE&#125;&quot;)</span><br><span class=\"line\">print(f&quot;获取到 __VIEWSTATEGENERATOR: &#123;__VIEWSTATEGENERATOR&#125;&quot;)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 5. 处理验证码</span><br><span class=\"line\"># 找到验证码图片的 URL</span><br><span class=\"line\">code_img_url = &#x27;https://so.gushiwen.cn/RandCode.ashx&#x27;</span><br><span class=\"line\">response_code = session.get(url=code_img_url, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 将验证码图片保存到本地</span><br><span class=\"line\">with open(&#x27;code.jpg&#x27;, &#x27;wb&#x27;) as f:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    f.write(response_code.content)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 手动输入验证码</span><br><span class=\"line\">code_text = input(&quot;请查看本地 code.jpg 图片并输入验证码：&quot;)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 6. 封装 POST 请求参数</span><br><span class=\"line\">data = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#x27;__VIEWSTATE&#x27;: __VIEWSTATE,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#x27;__VIEWSTATEGENERATOR&#x27;: __VIEWSTATEGENERATOR,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#x27;from&#x27;: &#x27;http://so.gushiwen.cn/user/collect.aspx&#x27;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#x27;email&#x27;: &#x27;your_email@example.com&#x27;,  # 替换为你的账号</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#x27;pwd&#x27;: &#x27;your_password&#x27;,             # 替换为你的密码</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#x27;code&#x27;: code_text,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#x27;denglu&#x27;: &#x27;登录&#x27;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">print(&quot;正在发送登录请求...&quot;)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 7. 发送 POST 请求进行登录</span><br><span class=\"line\">response_post = session.post(url=url_login, data=data, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"># 8. 验证登录结果</span><br><span class=\"line\"># 登录成功后，通常会跳转到个人页面，我们可以判断响应内容</span><br><span class=\"line\">if response_post.status_code == 200:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    # 简单判断：如果页面包含特定关键词，则认为登录成功</span><br><span class=\"line\">    if &#x27;您的收藏&#x27; in response_post.text:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        print(&quot;登录成功！已跳转至个人收藏页面。&quot;)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    else:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        print(&quot;登录失败，请检查账号密码或验证码。&quot;)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        # 可以将响应当作文件打开查看具体原因</span><br><span class=\"line\">        with open(&#x27;login_result.html&#x27;, &#x27;w&#x27;, encoding=&#x27;utf-8&#x27;) as f:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            f.write(response_post.text)</span><br><span class=\"line\">else:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    print(&quot;网络请求异常&quot;)</span><br><span class=\"line\">## 四、 总结</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">本文通过模拟登录古诗文网，重点演示了如何处理 ASP.NET 网站特有的隐藏参数以及验证码的应对流程。核心技巧在于：</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">1.  **Session 维持**：使用 `requests.Session()` 确保在获取参数、下载验证码、提交表单这一系列过程中 Cookie 的一致性。</span><br><span class=\"line\">2.  **动态参数解析**：利用 `BeautifulSoup` 在发起请求前动态抓取服务器生成的状态码。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">希望本文对你的爬虫学习有所帮助！</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>","categories":[{"name":"技术开发","path":"api/categories/技术开发.json"},{"name":"Python爬虫","path":"api/categories/Python爬虫.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"Spider","path":"api/tags/Spider.json"},{"name":"Requests","path":"api/tags/Requests.json"},{"name":"BeautifulSoup","path":"api/tags/BeautifulSoup.json"}]}